  "system": {
    "localizationKey": "",
    "description": "<p>Creates an impassable barrier up to 6 m in radius for 2 rounds, plus one further round for every additional 10 HP burned.</p><p>The barrier ignores all damage. Indirect spells can be cast through it. Lorik's Hammer has a 70% chance to destroy it.</p><p>The caster is Rooted for the duration and cannot take any actions.</p><p>Can be cast as a Reaction only if the caster or an ally is attacked.</p>",
